        "caption": "LIANYUNGANG, CHINA - JUNE 15: Construction machines of Caterpillar Inc. stand ready for shipment at Lianyungang port on June 15, 2020 in Lianyungang, Jiangsu Province of China. (Photo by Wang Chun/VCG via Getty Images)",
